["<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:由来\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">由来</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">由来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>地名<rp>(</rp><rt>ちめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>由来<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>しら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べてみた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">查了一下这个地名的由来。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺らぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆらぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摇晃；摇摆；震动；颤动；摇晃不定；动摇；变得不稳定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变松弛；松弛（如绳子）；变得不紧张；放松；放松警惕；（寒冷）缓和；减弱；（监管等）变得松懈；变软（如地面、表情）；（冰）部分融化；减慢；降低（如速度）；（市场价格）小幅下跌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">松开；放松；放松（注意力、努力等）；松懈（警惕）；消除（紧张感）；放宽（规则）；松动（管制）；放松（限制）；降低（速度）；减速；放慢；使（坡度）变得更平缓</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211508\">その<ruby>規則<rp>(</rp><rt>きそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>最近<rp>(</rp><rt>さいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>緩<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>められた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个规则最近被放缓了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩やか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるやか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">松的；不紧的；平缓的；缓慢的；宽松的；不严格的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222599\">この<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>規律<rp>(</rp><rt>きりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がやや<ruby>緩<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やかだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学校的纪律很缓慢。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">世</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">世界；社会；公众；人生；一生；时代；年代；时期；世代；统治；统治时期；世道；时局；存在的世界；生存的世界</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145130\"><ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>動向<rp>(</rp><rt>どうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>左右<rp>(</rp><rt>さゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">报纸决定了世界的动作。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">要因</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よういん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">因素；主要原因</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">因</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶液</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようえき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">溶液</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用件</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">业务；待办事项；应当完成的事情；需要传达的信息</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216994\">ご<ruby>用件<rp>(</rp><rt>ようけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をうけたまわりましょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能否把你的用途转移到周围?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">養護</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护理；养护；照护</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用紙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">空白表格；空白单据；纸张</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228563\">いま、この<ruby>用紙<rp>(</rp><rt>ようし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まなくてはいけないのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">现在,你应该写在这张纸上吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">様式</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようしき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">样式；形式；模式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219948\">この<ruby>服装<rp>(</rp><rt>ふくそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>様式<rp>(</rp><rt>ようしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパリに<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种服装在巴黎开始了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">要する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">需要；要求；耗费</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180366\"><ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるということは<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>忍耐力<rp>(</rp><rt>にんたいりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>要<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">教导需要很多耐心。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">要請</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">请求；呼吁；要求；恳请；公理；公设</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154086\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせるように<ruby>要請<rp>(</rp><rt>ようせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我要求他告诉我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">養成</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">培养；训练；教育；开发；修养</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">様相</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">样相；面貌；状态；样态；模态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217279\">コンピューターが<ruby>産業<rp>(</rp><rt>さんぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>様相<rp>(</rp><rt>ようそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きく<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">计算机已经大大改变了行业的形象。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用品</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようひん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用品；用具；物品；器具；商品；设备</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188967\"><ruby>衛生<rp>(</rp><rt>えいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>用品<rp>(</rp><rt>ようひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>場<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどこですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">卫生用品店在哪里?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">洋風</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようふう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">西洋风格；西方风格</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用法</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">使用方法；用法；使用说明</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213440\">その２<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>用法<rp>(</rp><rt>ようほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>区別<rp>(</rp><rt>くべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>明瞭<rp>(</rp><rt>めいりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这两种语言的使用方式的区别很明显。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">要望</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">要求；请求</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216991\">ご<ruby>要望<rp>(</rp><rt>ようぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>により<ruby>地図<rp>(</rp><rt>ちず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">根据您的要求发送地图。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">余暇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">闲暇；闲暇时间；空闲时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192933\">ユリコは<ruby>余暇<rp>(</rp><rt>よか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ける。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">尤里科在休闲时间生花。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予感</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预感；直觉；预觉；有预感；预感到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98678\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らが<ruby>仲良<rp>(</rp><rt>なかよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くやっていけない<ruby>予感<rp>(</rp><rt>よかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们觉得自己不能做得好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">余興</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よきょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（宴会等的）余兴节目；助兴表演；助兴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">預金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">存款；银行账户</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108131\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>銀行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>多額<rp>(</rp><rt>たがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>預金<rp>(</rp><rt>よきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在银行里存了很多钱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抑圧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よくあつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抑制；制止；压制；镇压</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206727\">その<ruby>暴動<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼうどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なく<ruby>抑圧<rp>(</rp><rt>よくあつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种叛乱被迫抑制。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">浴室</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よくしつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浴室；盥洗室</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222844\">この<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>浴室<rp>(</rp><rt>よくしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">房子里有两间浴室。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抑制</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よくせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">控制；抑制；压制；约束；限制；阻止；遏制</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101806\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>いか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>抑制<rp>(</rp><rt>よくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することができなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他无法阻止愤怒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">欲深い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よくふかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">贪心；贪婪；欲望强烈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">欲望</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よくぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">欲望；欲求；贪欲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78761\"><ruby>欲望<rp>(</rp><rt>よくぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>愛<rp>(</rp><rt>あい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>混同<rp>(</rp><rt>こんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要把欲望和爱情混为一谈。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8798303\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">横綱</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よこづな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（相扑）横纲（最高级别）；冠军力士；某领域最佳；精英中的精英；佼佼者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">葦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">芦苇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194112\">もう<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>右<rp>(</rp><rt>みぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ—ようし！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">向右转一点,好吧!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">善し悪し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よしあし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">是非；好坏；优劣；适当性；优缺点并存；利弊兼有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"94943\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>善<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しがわからない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她不知道好事和坏事。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予想</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预期；预测；预报；推测</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232440\">あなたはどんな<ruby>結果<rp>(</rp><rt>けっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>予想<rp>(</rp><rt>よそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你期待什么样的结果?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">余所見</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よそみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\